{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world has declared war on God. In response, God has declared war on the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words -\u00a0<strong>it\u2019s time for that fucking crusade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent FPS with relentless combat inspired by titles like DOOM Eternal, Bloodborne and Elden Ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to return the <strong>fear of God</strong> to this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.poster.avif?t=1769216812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.webm?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.mp4?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Majestic yet Brutal Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the <strong>Dragonsword</strong>, a living dragon forged into a weapon of divine wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield over 40\u00a0<strong>devastating holy powers</strong>\u00a0- like turning enemy blood into guillotines or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with absolute <strong>aura</strong>: soar into the skies with\u00a0<strong>Flame,\u00a0walk on hurricanes, surf on lightning bolts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy mortality: <strong>heal by taking damage.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through lightning, swords and explosions completely unscathed - just to\u00a0<strong>intimidate\u00a0</strong>your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic Blend Between Religion and Dark Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of Earth has been banished to\u00a0<strong>The Planet Graveyard</strong>\u00a0- a star system where dying worlds and fallen civilizations are exiled to rot. Across this cosmic necropolis, <strong>Gothic cathedrals and towering spires</strong> cast their shadows over kingdoms in ruin. Here the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> thrives, an ancient cult whose influence strangles every corner of existence<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conquering the entire world, they wish to go even further - to usurp the throne of <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear your way through vast mystical levels to hunt down and execute those who ruined the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/4958c1165de6a409aa096086c6457de0.poster.avif?t=1769216812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/4958c1165de6a409aa096086c6457de0.webm?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/4958c1165de6a409aa096086c6457de0.mp4?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008930?t=1769216812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008930?t=1769216812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/5b2d99e6a1b43ed92ed7c89042c61885389cf544/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769216812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/5b2d99e6a1b43ed92ed7c89042c61885389cf544/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769216812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, Intense Violence"},"demos":[{"appid":4153940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire world has declared war on God. In response, God has declared war on the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words -\u00a0<strong>it\u2019s time for that fucking crusade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLY Intentions</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent FPS with relentless combat inspired by titles like DOOM Eternal, Bloodborne and Elden Ring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Crusader</strong>, destined to return the <strong>fear of God</strong> to this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.poster.avif?t=1769216812\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.webm?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008930/extras/d5a9139098553101aa26e8374b6b379d.mp4?t=1769216812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Majestic yet Brutal Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the <strong>Dragonsword</strong>, a living dragon forged into a weapon of divine wrath.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield over 40\u00a0<strong>devastating holy powers</strong>\u00a0- like turning enemy blood into guillotines or calling down Comets from divine trebuchets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move with absolute <strong>aura</strong>: soar into the skies with\u00a0<strong>Flame,\u00a0walk on hurricanes, surf on lightning bolts.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy mortality: <strong>heal by taking damage.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through lightning, swords and explosions completely unscathed - just to\u00a0<strong>intimidate\u00a0</strong>your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Epic Blend Between Religion and Dark Fantasy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of Earth has been banished to\u00a0<strong>The Planet Graveyard</strong>\u00a0- a star system where dying worlds and fallen civilizations are exiled to rot. Across this cosmic necropolis, <strong>Gothic cathedrals and towering spires</strong> cast their shadows over kingdoms in ruin. Here the <strong>Order of Majistos</strong> thrives, an ancient cult whose influence strangles every corner of existence<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After conquering the entire world, they wish to go even further - to usurp the throne of <strong>God</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear your way through vast mystical levels to hunt down and execute those who ruined the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap